litate easy retrieval.&#10;&#10;&#128313; KEY OUTPUTS / DELIVERABLES&#10;• Timely and accurate data entry and record updating.&#10;• Accurate preparation and maintenance of departmental records and reports.&#10;• Safe storage and organisation of documents for easy retrieval when required.&#10;• Strict adherence to relevant departmental policies, procedures and processes.&#10;• Timely retrieval, processing and updating of information within the relevant systems." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.prc.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[34,64][686,337]" /><node index="1" text="Requirements" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.prc.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[34,364][191,399]" /><node index="2" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.prc.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[0,390][79,471]" /><node index="3" text="High school certificate with an overall grade of C+ or above." resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.prc.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[60,414][626,443]" /><node index="4" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.prc.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-click